# Catppuccin Mocha inspired dircolors.
# Palette reference: https://github.com/catppuccin/catppuccin

COLORTERM ?*
TERM *color*
TERM *direct*
TERM xterm*
TERM screen*
TERM tmux*
TERM rxvt*
TERM linux

RESET 0
NORMAL 0
FILE 0
MULTIHARDLINK 0

